    Best:0.6969 Time:120s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.696939\nTraining time: 134s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c9dbf1ce-4d9e-4700-b9a8-893162bb20c1\nTotal time: 136s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 12:04:33,083\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761451473083852363\n2025-10-26 12:04:33,097\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761451473097870863\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if\
