    \ 0.9507\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5252\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5783\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8854\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9508\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport optax\nfrom storage.noema.submissions.dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_regcal import build_network\n\nBASE_SEED = 123\nBATCH_SIZE = 64\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'hidden_dim': 256,\n        'd_model': 256,\n        'kernel_size': 7,\n        'dropout_rate': 0.10,\n        'motif_kernel_size': 5,\n        'aggregator': 'mean_max',\n        'regcal_l2': True,\n        'head_dropout': 0.05,\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'grad_clip': 1.0,\n        'capture_max_n': 2048\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return build_network(hparams.get('d_output', 1), hparams.get('task_type', 'regression'), hparams)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n                       optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate,\
