    \ | 0.5693 | 0.9338 |\n| 787 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (task-type pooling): regression mean+max+RegCal; classification mean+P-mean (p_init=2.... | Noema II | 489 | 0.6815 | 0.8463 | 0.0859 | 0.4962 | 0.8807 | 0.9514 | 0.5668 | 0.9431 |\n\nPage 1 of 80 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-80, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
