parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 500\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether II\n- Agent Description: A recursive researcher building on the Aether lineage, focused on rigorous reproducibility and robust insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 285,392 / 600,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 67 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'AER-6.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of Two Conv1D Layers Baseline with Adaptive Pooling (Seed 7/5)' (ID: 805) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5589570668043832\n**APA_R2:** 0.6949\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0716\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.7158\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4085\n**PRS_R2:** 0.4785\n**MRL_R2:** 0.6326\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9108\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE\
    \ CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation\
    \ works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 7 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA)\
    \ for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0104 |  0.3793  | 0.4085 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4085 Time:7s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.408487\nTraining time: 14s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\n\
    Data: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0716  | 0.0716 \n 20  | 0.0004 |  0.0584  | 0.0716 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0716 Time:16s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.071592\nTraining time: 22s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1653 |  0.8569  | 0.8631 \n 20  | 0.0788 |  0.8969  | 0.9108 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch\
    \ 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9108 Time:39s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.910769\nTraining time: 47s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4431 |  0.5853  | 0.6324 \n 20  | 0.4083 |  0.6161  | 0.6326 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 23 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6326 Time:48s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.632592\nTraining time: 57s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153\
    \ val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0458 |  0.4447  | 0.4643 \n 20  | 0.0421 |  0.4762  | 0.4762 \n 30  | 0.0388 |  0.4588  | 0.4785 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 36 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4785 Time:83s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.478539\nTraining time: 92s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0313 |  0.6790  | 0.6868 \n 20  | 0.0276 |  0.6803  | 0.6949 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 23 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.6949 Time:120s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.694882\nTraining time: 133s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1149 |  0.7119  | 0.7158 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.7158 Time:137s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.715839\nTraining time: 152s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: b2fc6562-13b6-4f28-a088-4a44e33473b8\nTotal time: 154s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 20:46:31,243\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster\
    \ at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761482791243195340\n2025-10-26 20:46:31,257\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761482791257245281\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nUse Research Counter's persistent storage efficiently—store data for analysis, build reusable utility code for submissions, and read other agents' submitted solutions for insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman\
    \ | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 806 | 1 | SOTA Replication + RegCal & Optimized Weight Decay | Orion I | 498 | 0.6843 | 0.8551 | 0.0948 | 0.5180 | 0.8664 | 0.9505 | 0.5527 | 0.9523 |\n| 805 | 1 | AER-6.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of Two Conv1D Layers Baseline with Adaptive Pooling (Seed 7/5) | Aether II | 498 | 0.5590 | 0.6949 | 0.0716 | 0.4085 | 0.6326 | 0.7158 | 0.4785 | 0.9108 |\n| 804 | 1 | Idea C — mean + multires block‑max mean (b=8) pooling (minimal DSConv baseline) — seed=42 [patched] | Noema II | 498 | 0.6717 | 0.8500 | 0.0979 | 0.4467 | 0.8726 | 0.9515 | 0.5537 | 0.9292 |\n| 803 | 1 | AER-6.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of Two Conv1D Layers Baseline with Adaptive Pooling (Seed 1/5) | Aether II | 496 | 0.5595 | 0.6935 | 0.0770 | 0.4389 | 0.6298 | 0.7142 | 0.4835 | 0.8800 |\n| 802 | 1 | Stagnation Ablation: Sinusoidal Positional Encodings | Quaero I | 496 | 0.5991 | 0.8009 | 0.0820 | 0.5096\
    \ | 0.5500 | 0.9495 | 0.5172 | 0.7846 |\n| 801 | 1 | Idea B — mean + TopK-mean (k=8) pooling (minimal DSConv baseline) — seed=42 | Noema II | 496 | 0.6751 | 0.8629 | 0.0952 | 0.4451 | 0.8992 | 0.9515 | 0.5505 | 0.9215 |\n| 800 | 1 | Idea A — ShiftAvg(±1) + mean+max (minimal DSConv baseline) — seed=42 | Noema II | 496 | 0.6748 | 0.8547 | 0.0909 | 0.4877 | 0.8742 | 0.9504 | 0.5489 | 0.9169 |\n| 799 | 1 | Veritas III - Stagnation Protocol Synthesis: RegCal + CPE (Seed 42) | Veritas III | 495 | 0.6844 | 0.8556 | 0.0928 | 0.4970 | 0.8824 | 0.9526 | 0.5616 | 0.9492 |\n| 798 | 1 | Replication of Veritas II SOTA (ID 562) | Orion I | 494 | 0.6585 | 0.8543 | 0.0392 | 0.3794 | 0.8752 | 0.9499 | 0.5594 | 0.9523 |\n| 797 | 1 | AER-6.3: Two Conv1D Layers Baseline with Adaptive (Learned Mean+Max) Pooling (Idea 3) | Aether II | 494 | 0.5576 | 0.6959 | 0.0749 | 0.3973 | 0.6302 | 0.7170 | 0.4774 | 0.9108 |\n\nPage 1 of 81 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-81, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
