    \  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1300 |  0.8969  | 0.9046 \n 20  | 0.0317 |  0.8954  | 0.9169 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 29 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9169 Time:63s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.916923\nTraining time: 73s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c17789f2-889a-404d-bafb-9f736ff332e0\nTotal time: 216s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 23:49:07,629\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761493747629799940\n2025-10-26 23:49:07,643\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761493747643393088\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n\
    - You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 823 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + minimal CPE (DWConv3 + sinusoidal residual) — seed=42 | Noema II | 511 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 822 | 1 | CPE-Minimal: DSConv + mean+max + residual CPE (DWConv3 + sinusoidal) — seed=42 | Noema II | 511 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 821 | 1 | AER-6.6: Two Conv1D Layers Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + CPE (Idea 3 + Idea from Archive 27) | Aether II | 509 | 0.6325 | 0.8420 | 0.0741 | 0.4393 | 0.6329 | 0.9515 |\
    \ 0.5709 | 0.9169 |\n| 820 | 1 | Follow-up on PE Dependence: 4-Layer CNN + Sinusoidal PE | Quaero I | 509 | 0.6085 | 0.8138 | 0.0408 | 0.4160 | 0.5989 | 0.9509 | 0.5604 | 0.8785 |\n| 819 | 1 | AER-6.5: Two Conv1D Layers Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal (L2 Norm + Dropout 0.05) | Aether II | 508 | 0.5636 | 0.6844 | 0.0774 | 0.4449 | 0.6345 | 0.7139 | 0.4792 | 0.9108 |\n| 818 | 1 | PE Dependence Control: 3-Layer CNN without PE | Quaero I | 508 | 0.5332 | 0.6721 | 0.0674 | 0.3979 | 0.5609 | 0.7106 | 0.4899 | 0.8338 |\n| 817 | 1 | Follow-up on PE Dependence: 3-Layer CNN + Sinusoidal PE | Quaero I | 507 | 0.6090 | 0.8102 | 0.0789 | 0.4496 | 0.5787 | 0.9505 | 0.5444 | 0.8508 |\n| 816 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal head rebalancing only (reg=160, cls=96) — LayerNorm — seed=42 | Noema II | 507 | 0.6813 | 0.8541 | 0.0755 | 0.4880 | 0.8875 | 0.9508 | 0.5682 | 0.9446 |\n| 815 | 1 | Veritas III - Deep CPE Integration into RegCal-DualPath (Seed 42) | Veritas III | 506 | 0.6708 | 0.8485 | 0.0783 | 0.4935\
    \ | 0.8221 | 0.9508 | 0.5703 | 0.9323 |\n| 814 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + RMSNorm + head rebalancing (reg=160, cls=96) — seed=42 | Noema II | 505 | 0.6800 | 0.8516 | 0.0880 | 0.4865 | 0.8807 | 0.9515 | 0.5574 | 0.9446 |\n\nPage 1 of 83 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-83, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
