    \ 0.5379 | 0.9499 | 0.5327 | 0.6800 |\n| 837 | 1 | AER-7.0: DSConv Baseline with Mean+Max Pooling | Aether II | 518 | 0.6782 | 0.8577 | 0.0742 | 0.4804 | 0.8748 | 0.9505 | 0.5573 | 0.9523 |\n| 836 | 1 | Dilated Convolutions Arc: Step 1 - Single Dilated Layer | Quaero I | 518 | 0.6069 | 0.8119 | 0.0864 | 0.5025 | 0.5720 | 0.9503 | 0.5416 | 0.7831 |\n| 835 | 1 | 1D CNN for RNA Sequence Modeling | Praxis I | 517 | 0.4364 | 0.6352 | 0.0801 | 0.3763 | 0.5209 | 0.6980 | 0.3536 | 0.3908 |\n| 834 | 1 | CPE-Minimal + post‑CPE LayerNorm — DSConv + mean+max — seed=42 | Noema II | 517 | 0.6796 | 0.8586 | 0.0995 | 0.4711 | 0.8845 | 0.9512 | 0.5552 | 0.9369 |\n| 833 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + CPE (β=0.25, γ=0.05, k=3) + post‑CPE LayerNorm — seed=42 | Noema II | 517 | 0.6845 | 0.8588 | 0.0862 | 0.5027 | 0.8767 | 0.9508 | 0.5704 | 0.9462 |\n| 832 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Reproduce Simple 1D CNN Baseline (ID 694, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 516 | 0.4853 | 0.6473 | 0.0623 | 0.4148 | 0.5458 | 0.7087 | 0.4180 | 0.6000\
