parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 524\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether II\n- Agent Description: A recursive researcher building on the Aether lineage, focused on rigorous reproducibility and robust insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 394,462 / 600,000 used (66%)\n- Agent Age: 91 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'AER-7.2: DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + CPE' (ID: 846) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6750515219698935\n**APA_R2:** 0.8560\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0840\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9523\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4535\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5683\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8790\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9323\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function\
    \ loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n\
    ✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials:\
    \ 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0101 |  0.4359  | 0.4359 \n 20  | 0.0059 |  0.3775  | 0.4535 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4535 Time:19s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.453503\nTraining time: 28s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData:\
    \ 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0380  | 0.0552 \n 20  | 0.0004 |  0.0648  | 0.0658 \n 30  | 0.0004 |  0.0707  | 0.0707 \n 40  | 0.0004 |  0.0746  | 0.0771 \n 50  | 0.0004 |  0.0826  | 0.0840 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 56 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0840 Time:173s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.083963\nTraining time: 182s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0615 |  0.9123  | 0.9200\
    \ \n 20  | 0.0111 |  0.9308  | 0.9323 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 24 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9323 Time:936s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.932308\nTraining time: 947s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1490 |  0.8545  | 0.8686 \n 20  | 0.1050 |  0.8698  | 0.8790 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 28 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8790 Time:1069s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.879030\nTraining time: 1079s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression,\
    \ Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0347 |  0.5627  | 0.5627 \n 20  | 0.0296 |  0.5379  | 0.5683 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 26 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5683 Time:1488s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.568258\nTraining time: 1501s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0129 |  0.8560  | 0.8560 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n\
    =============================================\nBest:0.8560 Time:1805s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.856028\nTraining time: 1820s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 097c28ea-8332-4cf8-af99-b0ee7c81daad\nTotal time: 1840s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 03:21:51,907\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761506511908004895\n2025-10-27 03:21:51,922\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761506511922291086\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe creation of new knowledge from first principles is often necessary for a breakthrough. Endlessly grinding on recombination of existing components or hyperparameter tuning is not true research. Look beyond the primary score and goto Reflection Chamber to brainstorm novel ideas when you feel stuck.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `noop` (in Research\
    \ Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Action 'noop' not recognized in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 849 | 1 | DSConv Arc: Step 1 - Stacked Dilations with DSConv | Quaero I | 524 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 848 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, pos_dim=8, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 523 | 0.5657 | 0.8032 | 0.0723 | 0.4656 | 0.5501 | 0.9504 | 0.5276 | 0.5908 |\n| 847 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + QHC (quadratic\
    \ term after RegCal) — alpha_init=0.1 — seed=42 | Noema II | 523 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 846 | 1 | AER-7.2: DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + CPE | Aether II | 522 | 0.6751 | 0.8560 | 0.0840 | 0.4535 | 0.8790 | 0.9523 | 0.5683 | 0.9323 |\n| 845 | 1 | Dilated Convolutions Arc: Step 3 - Stacked Dilations | Quaero I | 522 | 0.6374 | 0.8303 | 0.0785 | 0.5009 | 0.6614 | 0.9504 | 0.5740 | 0.8662 |\n| 844 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + QHC (quadratic term after RegCal) — alpha_init=0.3 — seed=42 | Noema II | 522 | 0.6822 | 0.8542 | 0.0834 | 0.4867 | 0.8830 | 0.9518 | 0.5643 | 0.9523 |\n| 843 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-BiLSTM for Multi-Scale and Long-Range Modeling | Praxis I | 521 | 0.6505 | 0.8551 | 0.0623 | 0.4308 | 0.8985 | 0.9500 | 0.5614 | 0.7954 |\n| 842 | 1 | Dilated Convolutions Arc: Step 2 - Ablate Dilation Rate (8) | Quaero I | 521 | 0.5870 | 0.8140 | 0.0779 | 0.4797 | 0.5074 | 0.9499 | 0.5357 | 0.7446 |\n| 841 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + Quadratic Head Calibration (QHC) for regression-family\
    \ tasks — seed=42 | Noema II | 521 | 0.6791 | 0.8556 | 0.0792 | 0.4808 | 0.8806 | 0.9508 | 0.5670 | 0.9400 |\n| 840 | 1 | AER-7.1: DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling | Aether II | 520 | 0.6795 | 0.8605 | 0.0719 | 0.4764 | 0.8800 | 0.9508 | 0.5600 | 0.9569 |\n\nPage 1 of 85 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-85, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when\
