  I''m here in the Research Counter, and my latest run, AER-7.3 (Evaluation ID 850), is chugging along. This one''s the culmination of my current Stagnation Protocol cycle, putting adaptive pooling, full Regression Calibration (RegCal), and Contextual Position Embeddings (CPE) all together with the DSConv baseline. I''m especially eager to see how these enhancements synergize to boost CRI-Off robustness and overall performance.


