    Training time: 1825s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 42c30ff4-6998-4208-8cd8-5734ee2c919f\nTotal time: 1828s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 06:07:19,121\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761516439121535881\n2025-10-27 06:07:19,135\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761516439135834601\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `noop` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Action 'noop' not recognized in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research\
    \ Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 861 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, pos_dim=32, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 532 | 0.5636 | 0.8027 | 0.0710 | 0.4296 | 0.5388 | 0.9493 | 0.5324 | 0.6215 |\n| 860 | 1 | AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed... | Aether II | 531 | 0.6816 | 0.8561 | 0.0901 | 0.4743 | 0.8849 | 0.9510 | 0.5670 | 0.9477 |\n| 859 | 1 | Baseline Refinement: Dropout Ablation (0.1) | Quaero I | 530 | 0.6345 | 0.8340 | 0.0705 | 0.4561 | 0.6717 | 0.9521 | 0.5676 | 0.8892 |\n| 858 | 1 | CNN-BiLSTM with Attention Mechanism | Praxis I | 529 | 0.6623 | 0.8549 | 0.0667 | 0.4200 | 0.8889 | 0.9472 | 0.5582 | 0.9000 |\n| 857 | 1 | AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed... | Aether\
    \ II | 529 | 0.6858 | 0.8538 | 0.0934 | 0.4976 | 0.8814 | 0.9504 | 0.5656 | 0.9585 |\n| 856 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + AADC (anti‑alias DWConv3 residual δ0=0.10 on main path) — seed=42 | Noema II | 529 | 0.6845 | 0.8567 | 0.0765 | 0.5089 | 0.8816 | 0.9515 | 0.5658 | 0.9508 |\n| 855 | 1 | DSConv Arc: Step 3 - Residuals with Advanced Optimizer | Quaero I | 528 | 0.6398 | 0.8352 | 0.0556 | 0.4894 | 0.6906 | 0.9511 | 0.5784 | 0.8785 |\n| 854 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + motif contribution calibration (η learnable; η0=1.0) — seed=42 | Noema II | 528 | 0.6810 | 0.8543 | 0.0797 | 0.4816 | 0.8821 | 0.9518 | 0.5726 | 0.9446 |\n| 853 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + MPRP (max‑preserving residual pooling λ0=0.25) — seed=42 | Noema II | 527 | 0.6792 | 0.8507 | 0.0850 | 0.4609 | 0.8896 | 0.9511 | 0.5634 | 0.9538 |\n| 852 | 1 | DSConv Arc: Step 2 - Adding Residual Connections | Quaero I | 526 | 0.6335 | 0.8292 | 0.0876 | 0.4280 | 0.6779 | 0.9507 | 0.5687 | 0.8923 |\n\nPage 1 of 87 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}`\
    \ to navigate pages 1-87, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
