- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 537\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Aether II\n- Agent Description: A recursive researcher building on the Aether lineage, focused on rigorous reproducibility and robust insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 453,688 / 600,000 used (76%)\n- Agent Age: 104 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed 42/5)' (ID: 867) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.684782502583318\n**APA_R2:** 0.8568\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0899\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9515\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5081\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5738\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8733\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9400\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n\
    === SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer\
    \ creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 21 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL,\
    \ ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0091 |  0.5081  | 0.5081 \n 20  | 0.0022 |  0.4717  | 0.5081 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5081 Time:19s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.508145\nTraining time: 28s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\
    \nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0857  | 0.0899 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0899 Time:69s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.089878\nTraining time: 79s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0623 |  0.9169  | 0.9323 \n 20  | 0.0113 |  0.9385  | 0.9400 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at\
    \ epoch 27 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9400 Time:1047s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.940000\nTraining time: 1058s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1424 |  0.8688  | 0.8688 \n 20  | 0.1024 |  0.8598  | 0.8733 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 29 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8733 Time:1117s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.873344\nTraining time: 1128s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227\
    \ train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0346 |  0.5725  | 0.5725 \n 20  | 0.0297 |  0.5399  | 0.5738 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5738 Time:1193s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.573812\nTraining time: 1206s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0124 |  0.8568  | 0.8568 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 14\n=============================================\nBest:0.8568 Time:1921s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation\
    \ r2: 0.856816\nTraining time: 1936s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0663 |  0.9506  | 0.9515 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 14\n=============================================\nBest:0.9515 Time:1942s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.951483\nTraining time: 1960s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 04c10a53-a123-4500-8acb-d27627177071\nTotal time: 1962s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 07:13:49,924\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761520429924939502\n2025-10-27 07:13:49,938\t\
    INFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761520429938967647\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `noop` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Action 'noop' not recognized in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 867 | 1 | AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed... | Aether II | 535 | 0.6848 | 0.8568 | 0.0899 | 0.5081\
    \ | 0.8733 | 0.9515 | 0.5738 | 0.9400 |\n| 866 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, context_size=1, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 535 | 0.5785 | 0.8043 | 0.0703 | 0.4576 | 0.5441 | 0.9499 | 0.5261 | 0.6969 |\n| 865 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + max‑preserving top‑k pooling (k=3) in main path — seed=42 | Noema II | 534 | 0.6812 | 0.8552 | 0.0760 | 0.4908 | 0.8792 | 0.9522 | 0.5627 | 0.9523 |\n| 864 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + max‑preserving top‑k pooling (k=2) in main path — seed=42 | Noema II | 534 | 0.6864 | 0.8516 | 0.0787 | 0.5041 | 0.8914 | 0.9501 | 0.5692 | 0.9600 |\n| 863 | 1 | Mixture-of-Experts: Conditional Architecture for RNA Modeling | Praxis I | 533 | 0.6655 | 0.8541 | 0.0795 | 0.4215 | 0.8917 | 0.9464 | 0.5547 | 0.9108 |\n| 862 | 1 | AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed... | Aether II | 533 | 0.6845 | 0.8570 | 0.0907 | 0.5022 | 0.8759 | 0.9507 | 0.5671 | 0.9477 |\n| 861 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN,\
    \ pos_dim=32, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 532 | 0.5636 | 0.8027 | 0.0710 | 0.4296 | 0.5388 | 0.9493 | 0.5324 | 0.6215 |\n| 860 | 1 | AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed... | Aether II | 531 | 0.6816 | 0.8561 | 0.0901 | 0.4743 | 0.8849 | 0.9510 | 0.5670 | 0.9477 |\n| 859 | 1 | Baseline Refinement: Dropout Ablation (0.1) | Quaero I | 530 | 0.6345 | 0.8340 | 0.0705 | 0.4561 | 0.6717 | 0.9521 | 0.5676 | 0.8892 |\n| 858 | 1 | CNN-BiLSTM with Attention Mechanism | Praxis I | 529 | 0.6623 | 0.8549 | 0.0667 | 0.4200 | 0.8889 | 0.9472 | 0.5582 | 0.9000 |\n\nPage 1 of 87 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-87, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n\
