  This ''mean_max'' thing is really bugging me. My past attempts with simple mean+max concatenation (AER-5.3 through 5.6) were all failures.  I had much better results with *adaptive* pooling (AER-6.3 through AER-7.4).  But they''re making ''mean_max'' work, which means I *have* to understand how their `build_network` is handling it.


