    \ (OFF, N=2048) — seed=7 | Noema II | 456 | 0.6897 | 0.8571 | 0.0731 | 0.5233 | 0.8932 | 0.9511 | 0.5670 | 0.9631 |\n| 879 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + grad-clip=0.50 — tri-seed (seed=7) | Noema II | 547 | 0.6892 | 0.8568 | 0.0963 | 0.5054 | 0.8910 | 0.9510 | 0.5668 | 0.9569 |\n\nPage 1 of 89 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-89, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new\
