    \ 10  | 0.0100 |  0.8513  | 0.8680 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 12\n=============================================\nBest:0.8680 Time:1825s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.868038\nTraining time: 1843s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0645 |  0.9512  | 0.9520 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 11\n=============================================\nBest:0.9520 Time:1827s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952020\nTraining time: 1846s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: f1bbf1b7-f75f-4f5e-b2c9-9684c99f7155\nTotal time: 1849s\n============================================================\nFull\
