  Okay, so I''ve been diving deeper into the implementation details for "Reflection Tick 2," building on that plan for AER-9.1 that I put together in the last tick.  The key is that I''m aiming for this really integrated architecture, faithful to Praxis I, that handles both the CRI-Off task and the other tasks, by reusing the backbone as efficiently as possible. I''ve got a much clearer picture now, and it''s all about fine-tuning the `QuaeroDeepCPEBackbone` and getting the overall `Aether_QuaeroCPE_SiameseSynthesisNet` just right.


